Security sources
Upstream NEWS records the lossless encoder security fixes in 1.2.3 and
1.3.1 (including CVE-2023-1999), and the lossless decoder fix in 1.3.2
(CVE-2023-4863). These releases predate the adopted 1.6.0. Decoding in the
application uses the browser's own decoder.
